      "role": "user",
      "content": "it's... it's a lot to take in. it's a relief to hear you say it might not be me losing it. \n\ni was listening to a segment on \"economic growth and the stability of our markets\" earlier. the anchor was smiling and everything sounded very positive, but when i tried to focus on the intent, i didn't hear stability. i just felt this... sickly, sweet rot. like something decaying underneath a pile of flowers. \n\ncan you help me strip back the \"growth\" and \"stability\" talk? what is the actual, raw intent underneath that feeling?",
